WEBVTT

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.270
You must be Watanabeno Tsuna-<i>sama.</i>

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:30.710
Minamotono Mitsunaka entered priesthood

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.330
and you follow his new name, Tadano Shinbochi.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.840
Evil spirit!

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:45.520
You are no ordinary evil spirit. A Horror!

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.390
The Minamoto family has been a bloodline

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:50.730
of Makai Knights since ancient times.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:55.730
As a servant of that household,
I also hold some skill!

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:03.440
Tadano Shinbochi tossed his own son outside the capital to rise in power.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:06.570
What? How did you come to know that?!

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:10.110
I hear that Shinbochi is at death's door.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.550
Even if he crosses to the other world,

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:16.480
he will not be able to escape his own darkness!

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.320
Silence!

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:27.520
It is the job of his retainer to cut away such ties!

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:52.820
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:01:52.820 --> 00:02:00.930
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:08.140
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:17.170
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:26.520
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:34.360
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:42.260
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:52.270
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:58.420
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:02:55.720 --> 00:03:02.950
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:07.950
"BROTHERS"

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:15.240
Then, one strike of my blade!

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:18.830
The evil spirit fled, leaving its arm behind!

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.780
Tsuna, what did you cut down?

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.720
Oh, Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>! Perfect timing.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.020
Take a look at this!

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.250
Oh? Where did it go?

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.460
What is this?!

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:44.860
Mother?!

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.700
Mother!

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.640
Y-Yorinobu!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.970
Are you all right?!

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.320
Could this be...?

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:11.230
No, I only cut off a single arm!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.660
G-Get it off of me!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.430
My Lord!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.770
Father!

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.910
It disappeared? This must be...

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.780
Forgive me, Yorimitsu.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:34.120
Yorimitsu. That name again.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.000
Who is Yorimitsu?

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.320
Tsuna.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.790
Mother!

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:49.030
You must bear through it, Raiko.

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:53.530
Your father and the
Light Palace is not to blame.

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:56.470
Then, why is it so cold?

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:59.700
Why must you and I suffer like this?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.710
Raiko...

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.850
I-I am so sorry, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.820
I used our savings to buy some rice cakes and ate them alone!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.290
The potatoes I got from helping the vegetable seller

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.130
are hidden behind the jars!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.300
A-Also! Also!

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.660
All your confessions are about food.

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.300
Did you dream about a girl?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.330
You were groaning really loudly!

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.980
E-Excuse me!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.240
Are you here, Seimei-<i>dono</i>?

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:46.590
Well, well! What delicious looking fried sweets!

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:51.030
As expected from the young master at the top of the Genji family!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.220
Thank you for the meal!

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:57.270
I remember seeing this <i>shiki</i> at the Light Palace.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:01.880
This <i>shiki</i> doll is the <i>onmyou</i> professor, Abeno Haruaki-<i>dono</i>'s...

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:07.010
Yeah. Due to various circumstances, it serves under me now.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.010
"My name is Shiki."

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.350
So delicious!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.950
Don't eat it all by yourself!

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:16.680
But, they're gifts for me.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.240
Right?

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.460
How naive.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.860
He fell for that kind of tactic so easily.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:29.130
This is what happens to a sheltered boy who meets an unsheltered girl.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:33.100
Yes. I'm sure he was raised with much love.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.700
So true.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:39.410
I see. A Horror in the shape of an arm.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:40.980
Right after what happened a few days ago.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.980
Horrors seem to be appearing at the homes of aristocrats often now.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:46.650
Please lend us your strength.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:49.250
You are not only known for your beauty,

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.120
but your strength against evil spirits as well.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:53.990
On top of that, you are the granddaughter of Abeno Haruaki-<i>dono.</i>

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:54.460
No.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.730
Seimei, how can you say that after eating all those sweets?!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.630
I said no.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:03.330
I mean, think about it. Whose house is he from?

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:05.770
Oh, I see.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.240
Well, the day and direction of the sun is bad today.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.600
It really is unfortunate.

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:10.610
I'll go.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.610
Huh?

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:13.240
Why are you so surprised?

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.580
A Horror appeared.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.340
No, well...

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:18.680
It could just be a giant slug that looks like an arm.

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.950
Oh, that's terrifying!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.090
However, it isn't something that you need to attend to, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.090
What are you both talking about?

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.180
If I say I'm going, I'm going!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:34.030
I wanted Seimei-<i>san</i> to come!

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:35.160
Why is it this guy?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.000
I can hear you.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:41.000
Goodness, what's so great about that woman?

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.200
Hey, Raiko.

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:44.970
Yorinobu, you are really persistent!

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.010
There is nothing between me and Seimei.

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:49.140
And, of course, we don't sleep in the same bed.

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.010
It isn't about that!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:54.820
Um, your armor...

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.850
Huh? What?

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:59.480
Let's go. I am worried about my father.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.500
Raiko, you say?

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.470
Are you sure?

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.500
Yes.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:15.070
He is a young man that
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i> has gotten close to lately.

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:18.870
I thought it was impossible, but it seems Kintoki is with him.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:23.210
We always used to call
Yorimitsu-<i>sama</i> by the name of Raiko.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:26.810
There is no way he could still be alive.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:30.380
Could he be a Horror?!

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.020
Lately, our master has been quite sick.

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:38.330
It may be that this
Raiko has cast a curse on him.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.330
I've returned, Tsuna.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.600
I have brought someone who will help us!

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.430
This is our retainer who has served our family for many years,

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:47.600
Watanabeno Tsuna.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.600
I see.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.070
There you are! This is Raiko.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:56.280
He is knowledgeable of evil spirits and will help us with this problem.

00:08:56.280 --> 00:09:00.110
Of course he knows of evil spirits well.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:01.280
Hey! That face!

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:04.410
Yes, it resembles that of Yorimitsu-<i>sama.</i>

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.190
Why must we be exiled from the capital?!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.860
We have been falsely accused!
I have not cursed anyone!

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:19.930
Tsuna?! What are you doing?

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.040
Come here!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.100
If you resist, we won't be easy on you!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:29.640
Hoh. I merely followed the darkness I felt.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:32.150
How interesting.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:36.780
I should ensure that no one interferes.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:42.220
I see. Raiko went to that house alone.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:47.430
Seimei, why did you not make sure to tag along?

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:54.170
That house should have memories
Raiko does not want to remember.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:10:00.740
If he overcomes your seal and loses control of his power...

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.140
This time, even we...

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.910
We can't turn a blind eye!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:05.810
We cannot.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:07.250
That's right, Seimei!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.650
What in the world were you thinking?

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:12.820
I wanted to see, that's all.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:14.290
See?

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:18.860
I wanted to see how Raiko confronts his own scars.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:22.600
How he overcomes it alone.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.870
I believe in him.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.470
He will definitely...

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:28.800
Seimei...

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:33.010
No matter what you think, we cannot allow the danger.

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:37.180
And of course, we cannot let a Horror run free.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:42.850
--Argh! Jeez! Fine!
--Wow, so pretty!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.480
Hurry, Seimei!

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:54.230
This is?!

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:57.030
It's the evil use of an Alchemist spell.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:59.160
The only one who can do this...

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:05.570
As I thought, it's you, Douman.

00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:07.510
I will not let you interfere.

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:10.880
I'll have the two of you stay here.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.710
My teacher has told me not to interfere,

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:17.350
but things have gotten quite interesting.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:21.660
I will see what kind of man that Raiko is.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.660
Seimei!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.190
Kintoki! Go on ahead!

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:52.690
Take care of stupid Raiko!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.180
Understood!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.220
Shit!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.040
Why are you alive?!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.270
We exiled you and your mother from the capital.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:24.370
There is no way you could survive all those evil spirits and bandits!

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.880
Now, Yorinobu! Stop this!

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.020
Father, please tell me!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.460
Who is he? This Yorimitsu?

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.460
The Golden Armor that is passed down the Minamoto family.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:41.900
I have been raised to inherit it since I was a child.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:47.030
But however much I asked, you have never shown it to me.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.200
Could it be...

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:51.970
Could it be the armor Raiko wears?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:02.120
Unfortunately, our master,
Tadano Shinbochi-<i>sama,</i>

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:06.120
was not talented enough to don the Golden Armor.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:15.000
Shinbochi-<i>sama</i> hoped to raise a child that would inherit it in his place.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:22.140
But, his aspiration was discovered by Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:27.580
I would accept the princess of the famous Fujiwara family of Nara

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:30.340
with great happiness!

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.010
My little sister has no objections.

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.850
Just one thing.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:36.820
Yes, anything you ask.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:41.020
The Golden Armor that is passed down your bloodline...

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.190
How did you come to know of that?

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:48.000
Of course, the one to inherit it will be the child of my sister.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:52.600
Well, the armor chooses its bearer.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.600
I already have a son named Yorimitsu.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:14:01.480
I cannot be sure if the armor will choose him or my future children.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.780
There is no problem if you only have one child.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.950
The child of this beautiful princess.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:15.620
If that is your only child, will he not inherit the armor?

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:19.890
Murder the current eldest son, Yorimitsu-<i>sama.</i>

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:23.900
That is what Michinaga-<i>sama</i> requested of him.

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:28.240
Michinaga-<i>sama</i> will soon obtain the Light Palace.

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:32.370
He wishes to have the Golden Knight at his side when that time comes.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:37.340
If we used the Golden Armor in the battles of man,

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:42.480
we will be able to fight not thousands, but tens of thousands.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:47.220
No, that armor is not something that can be used against man.

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:49.210
Shinbochi.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:55.090
Shinbochi-<i>sama</i> obeyed his wishes.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:07.070
The oldest son, Yorimitsu-<i>sama,</i> and his mother were exiled from the capital.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:12.410
And he ordered his retainer to train Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>, who remained,

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.580
to be worthy of inheriting the Golden Armor.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.460
I-Impossible.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:33.370
So the Yorimitsu they speak of is...!

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:38.940
You hate us and our master.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:42.310
That is why you have returned as a Horror!

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:44.780
Confess!

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:53.620
I have never hated my father or the servants who helped him.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:16:00.760
When I was a child, I didn't know who I was or what I should do.

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:06.430
I couldn't be like my father, who obeyed Michinaga to gain status.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:10.070
So, what could I do?

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:13.140
Then, I found myself.

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:15.370
Don't make up lies!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.070
Stop right there!

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.350
Is that you, Kintoki?

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:23.950
In the flesh! It has been a long time, Tsuna.

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:27.080
You've gotten quite old since I last saw you.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.930
And you haven't changed at all.

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:33.590
No matter how many years pass, you look like a child.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.830
Like him, you must be some kind of evil spirit!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.530
Evil spirit?!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.370
Say what you want of me,

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:43.500
but I will not forgive any insult against Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.540
Tsuna! The evil spirit...

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:47.940
The Horror, is you!

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:58.390
--What?!
--Tsuna's eyes!

00:16:58.390 --> 00:16:59.990
Impossible.

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:02.680
Impossible!

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:07.290
He's a Horror!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:11.500
He became possessed by the arm of the Horror he cut down.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:14.470
Impossible!

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:18.010
Stop saying such lies!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:22.340
But, Tsuna, what kind of darkness was inside of you?

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.550
You are not Yorimitsu-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:26.150
You're a monster.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:30.750
Yorimitsu-<i>sama</i> is dead. I murdered him!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:36.050
I see. Tsuna regretted exiling the young Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:39.530
He could not bear his feelings of guilt.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:58.110
He wanted to believe I was a monster and escape his own guilt.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:01.450
So that was the darkness you carried, Tsuna!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:13.390
Watch out!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.750
My Lord!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.470
Raiko! You are...

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:30.040
Thanks to the Golden Armor,
I managed to escape the Horrors.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:33.450
Then, I was saved by a troublesome woman.

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:39.150
Though she just wanted a
Makai Knight that would obey her.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:43.560
After some time, I went to visit the house I was born from.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.960
I didn't really have a plan.

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.800
Perhaps I wanted to surprise my father and the others

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:51.570
who thought I was dead.

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:54.130
Maybe I wanted to give them a complaint or two.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.340
--You did well.
--That's when I knew.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:10.120
Someone had to protect the innocent laughter of such a small child.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.790
The reason the Golden Armor came to me

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:17.790
was so I could become a
Makai Knight and protect the people.

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:22.830
Yorinobu, you were the one who showed me the way.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:26.860
The brilliant smile of my little brother.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:32.850
Brother!

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:38.180
Seimei!

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:43.680
Oh, I thought your hatred for your father made you a Horror by now.

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:46.020
What were you going to do if I did?

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:48.220
Of course, I'd run you over to death.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.690
I thought so.

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:53.490
Zaruba!

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:16.150
That is the legendary Golden Armor...

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:40.170
All right, here we go!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.730
Prepare yourself!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.440
Now, Raiko!

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:08.220
So that is the man named Raiko.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:18.950
As the eldest, you should stay here.

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:22.280
My name is Raiko. I am a Makai Knight.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:25.620
I don't plan on returning to the life of an aristocrat.

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:28.590
You must inherit everything from this family.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:32.790
You must protect the Seiwa Genji family.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:37.500
I will protect all of the people, as the Knight Garo.

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:39.060
Yes.

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:52.980
So you knew everything.

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:53.850
Yeah.

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:57.450
What? So I worried for nothing.

00:21:57.450 --> 00:22:01.020
Let me ask you, Seimei.
Do you want to return to the Abe family?

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.820
No. Never again.

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:05.160
Right?

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:06.590
So true.

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:38.130
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:45.070
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:52.240
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:59.180
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:02.750
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:06.220
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:16.750
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:40.690
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:48.390
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:50.990 --> 00:24:01.000
"Next Episode: SHINE AND RUIN"

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:54.580
Light and shadow.

00:23:54.580 --> 00:23:56.450
Black and white.

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.580
The contradiction makes them interesting.
